@startuml
title Submit and Review a Recruitment Request - Sequence Diagram
actor DepartmentHead as DeptHead
participant WebApp
participant Gateway
participant RequestController
participant RequestService
database PostgreSQL
participant NotificationService
DeptHead -> WebApp : submit request
WebApp -> Gateway : POST /recruitment-requests/{id}/submit
Gateway -> RequestController : RPC command
RequestController -> RequestService : submit(payload)
RequestService -> PostgreSQL : validate owner and current status
RequestService -> PostgreSQL : update request + create RequestLog
RequestService -> NotificationService : notify HR/Admin
RequestService --> RequestController : updated request
RequestController --> Gateway : response
Gateway --> WebApp : 200 / updated status
@enduml